      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Ruins of Shadow Haven [zone=1308]\n**Who:**\n- Record Keeper Ajar [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Coglixar Xorlopodil's Report [item=145308]\n- Netherbian Fungal Sample [item=145306]\n- Sealed Sterile Fungal Sample Bag [item=145257]\n- Shik`Nar Fungal Sample [Ruins of Shadow Haven]\n- Shik`Nar Fungal Sample [Paludal Depths]\n- Shrieker Fungal Sample [item=145299]\n- Silkworm Fungal Sample [item=145304]\n- Skeletal Fungal Sample [item=145303]\n- Steaon Alarenier's Report [item=145307]\n- Sterile Fungal Sample Bag [item=144286]\n- Underbulk Fungal Sample [Ruins of Shadow Haven]\n- Underbulk Fungal Sample [Firefall Pass]\n- Underbulk Fungal Sample [Paludal Depths]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Coglixar Xorlopodil [npc=57727]\n- Steaon Alarenier [ _Alchemy Supplies_]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Ruins of Shadow Haven (10 Points) [quest=12241]\n**Era:** | !Night of Shadows\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Oct 24 00:45:29 2022\nModified: Wed Feb 21 00:03:06 2024 | | **Night of Shadows Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this task from Record Keeper Ajar in Shadow Haven. He is located at /waypoint 1104, -1062, -46. He's on the Find tool (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, Record Keeper Ajar'\nRecord Keeper Ajar says, 'What what? There's too much to do. Too much to research and record. What do you [want]?'\nYou say, 'I want to find out what happened to Shadow Haven.'\nRecord Keeper Ajar pauses in his frantic note-taking and looks at you. 'Well. Okay. That is worth the interruption. If you want to know, go to Coglixar Xorlopodil and get his report.' He looks at you his, brows creased and nose up. 'Bring it back and I will translate it for you. It will be gibberish to you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Fungal Corruption'.\n\n---\n\nRecord Keeper Ajar would like you to gather information so he and others can find the cause of the infestation.\nAsk Coglixar Xorlopodil for his report.\n1\\. Converse with Coglixar Xorlopodil 0/1 Ruins of Shadow Haven\nCoglixar Xorlopodil is located at /way -1189, 746, -74 in the southwest section of the zone, in the southeastern corner.\nYou say, 'Hail, Coglixar Xorlopodil'\nCoglixar Xorlopodil says, in Gnomish, 'Hello. What?'\nYou say, 'How is your report?'\nCoglixar Xorlopodil says, in Gnomish, 'Ah well. I see. Well. Um. Well. [You see].'\nYou say, 'I see what?'\nCoglixar Xorlopodil says, in Gnomish, 'I [will not do] it.'\nYou say, 'You will not do what?'\nCoglixar Xorlopodil says, in Gnomish, 'I won't go out there. If the report is essential to Ajar, then someone else will need to [collect the samples].'\nYou say, 'I'll collect the samples.'\nYou have been given: Sterile Fungal Sample Bag\nYour task 'Fungal Corruption' has been updated.\nCoglixar Xorlopodil says, in Gnomish, 'Splendid. That'll work. I'll put what I need in your journal there, and you go collect fungal samples for me. You do have to go pretty far, but it is necessary. We need to see how far and wide the fungal bloom goes and if it is all as... abnormal as what is being reported. Put all of the specimens in this bag and return them to me.'\nCollect fungal samples from many creatures.\nUnderbulks, Shik`Nar, and Shriekers in Ruins of Shadow Haven and Paludal Depths. These creature may have something unusual about them.\nSkeletons and silkworms in Shadeweaver's Tangle.\nUnderbulks in Firefall Pass.\nNetherbians in Umbral Plains.\n2\\. Collect 1 Underbulk Fungal Sample(s) 0/1 Ruins of Shadow Haven\nUnderbulk Fungal Sample drops from \"an infested burrower\" and \"a corrupted scuttler\"\n3\\. Collect 1 Shik`Nar Fungal Sample(s) 0/1 Ruins of Shadow Haven\nShik`Nar Fungal Sample drops from \"a plagued shik`nar\" and \"a teeming shik`nar\"\n4\\. Collect 1 Shrieker Fungal Sample(s) 0/1 Ruins of Shadow Haven\nShrieker Fungal Sample drops from \"a mature sensate reishi\"\n5\\. Collect 1 Underbulk Fungal Sample(s) 0/1 Paludal Depths\nUnderbulk Fungal Sample drops from a royal guardian, a corrupted scuttler, and an infested burrower\n6\\. Collect 1 Shik`Nar Fungal Sample(s) 0/1 Paludal Depths\nShik`Nar Fungal Sample drops from a plagued shik`nar, a dead eyed shik`nar, a teeming shik`nar, and Toxiplax.\n7\\. Collect 1 Shrieker Fungal Sample(s) 0/1 Paludal Depths\nShrieker Fungal Sample drops from any mushroom-type NPC\n8\\. Collect 1 Skeletal Fungal Sample(s) 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nSkeletal Fungal Sample drops from a charred shade, a lesser shade, a minor shade, a skeletal brigand, a skeletal hunter, a skeletal thug, and scorched bones.\n9\\. Collect 1 Silkworm Fungal Sample(s) 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nSilkworm Fungal Sample drops from a xakra larva, and a xakra borer\n10\\. Collect 1 Underbulk Fungal Sample(s) 0/1 Firefall Pass\nUnderbulk Fungal Sample drops from \"a fissure fiend\" and \"a luclinite borer\"\n11\\. Collect 1 Netherbian Fungal Sample item=145306 0/1 Umbral Plains\nNetherbian Fungal Sample drops from several \"a Netherbian\" mobs in the north tunnel in Umbral Planes (ToL). See the item page to see what all it drops from.\n12\\. Seal the Sterile Fungal Sample Bag. 0/1 (ALL)\nCombine all the previously collected items in the Sterile Fungal Sample Bag received from Coglixar Xorlopodil.\n13\\. Deliver 1 Sealed Sterile Fungal Sample Bag to Coglixar Xorlopodil\nCoglixar Xorlopodil says, 'Ah very good. Come back [tomorrow] and I'll give you the report.'\nYou complete the trade with Coglixar Xorlopodil.\nYou say, 'I don't want to wait for tomorrow.'\nCoglixar Xorlopodil says, in Gnomish, 'Well. That's how long it will take me. If you want it done faster, Steaon Alarenier can do a test. I would prefer my method as his procedure is destructive, but if you're in a hurry, he can get the results in minutes. But only if you [insist].'\nYou say, 'I insist'\nCoglixar Xorlopodil sighs, obviously disappointed, and hands the bag back to you.\nYou offered 1 Sealed Sterile Fungal Sample Bag to Steaon Alarenier.\nSteaon Alarenier takes the bag and says, 'Oh Fungus. I'll assume that Coglixar wants this analyzed. This will only take me a minute. Please stay near. We don't want to lose the samples, and you have to start all over again.' He unseals the bag and pours a liquid inside and watches the smoke that rises from the bag with intense concentration. After a few moments he scribbles a report and hands it to you. 'Bring this back to Coglixar; he'll decipher the shorthand I used and make the real report.'\nYou complete the trade with Steaon Alarenier.\n14\\. Speak with Coglixar Xorlopodil after a day has passed. 0/1 (Ruins of Shadow Haven\n_Wait a day and ask Coglixar Xorlopodil for his report, or take the bag to Steaon Alarenier for his report._\nYou offered 1 Steaon Alarenier's Report to Coglixar Xorlopodil.\nCoglixar Xorlopodil sighs. I wish you were patient. Those fungi would have been so interesting to study. Oh well. Give me a moment and... here is your report for Record Keeper Ajar. Now leave me be.\nYou have been given: Coglixar Xorlopodil's Report\nYour task 'Fungal Corruption' has been updated.\nYou complete the trade with Coglixar Xorlopodil.\n_If you wait an in-game day and ask Coglixar Xorlopodil for his report:_\nYou say, 'Hail, Coglixar Xorlopodil'\nCoglixar Xorlopodil says, in Gnomish, 'That was very interesting. Thank you for gathering the samples. The dextrinoid infundibuliform sessile has dichotomous behaviors. Bring this report to Record Keeper Ajar, and he can explain it to you. I want to go back to my research.'\nYou have been given: Coglixar Xorlopodil's Report\nYour task 'Fungal Corruption' has been updated.\n**You gain 69+ AA at level 125**\n15\\. Deliver 1 Coglixar Xorlopodil's Report to Record Keeper Aja _[sic]_ 0/2 (Ruins of Shadow Haven)\nYou offered 1 Coglixar Xorlopodil's Report to Record Keeper Ajar.\nYou have been given: Coglixar Xorlopodil's Report\nYour task 'Fungal Corruption' has been updated.\nRecord Keeper Ajar stares at the report. His eyes flick back and forth so fast they seem to blur. 'That is intriguing. It seems that the owlbear spirit that rampaged through Shadow Haven spread a spiritual corruption that caused some extra fungal bloom. This bloom has spread the many fungal creatures outside of paludal caverns. Take this report to Tarson Lonewolf; he might be able to decipher the spiritual energy.\nYou complete the trade with Record Keeper Ajar.\n16\\. Deliver 1 Coglixar Xorlopodil's Report to Tarson Lonewolf 0/1 (Ruins of Shadow Haven)\nYou offered 1 Coglixar Xorlopodil's Report to Tarson Lonewolf.\nYour task 'Fungal Corruption' has been updated.\nThe report you delivered was useful.\nYou receive 7 copper .\nYou receive 6 silver .\nYou receive 1 gold .\nYou receive 354 platinum .\nYou have gained 1 mercenary ability point(s)! You now have 3 mercenary ability point(s).\nYou have gained 39 ability point(s)! You now have 69 ability point(s).\nYou gain experience! (0.000%)\nTarson Lonewolf spends a moment reading the report. His eyes grow big then he frowns. Once done he stares at you. 'You [will help me] look into this.'\nYou complete the trade with Tarson Lonewolf.\nThis leads into the next task, Spiritual Corruption [quest=12484].\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n354 platinum 1 gold 6 silver 7 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
