      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Ruins of Shadow Haven [zone=1308]\n**Who:**\n- Tarson Lonewolf [ _Shaman Guildmaster and Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 120\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Faintly Glowing Digested Pebble [item=145309]\n- Faintly Glowing Digested Stone [item=145310]\n- Glowing Rock [item=145313]\n- Glowing Stone [item=145312]\n- Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag [item=145315]\n- Spiritual Sample Bag [item=145314]\n- Weakly Glowing Pebble [item=145311]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Commander Yaminshavraylin [npc=57728]\n- High Spiritist Jimuul [npc=58026]\n- Lewena [npc=57820]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Ruins of Shadow Haven (10 Points) [quest=12241]\n**Era:** | !Night of Shadows\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 6 22:15:26 2022\nModified: Sat May 18 08:46:28 2024 | | **Night of Shadows Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this task from Tarson Lonewolf [npc=57884] in Ruins of Shadow Haven. You can find Tarson Lonewolf at /waypoint 1107, -1160, -46. He is on the find tool as well CTRL F.\n_This quest is received at the conclusion of the previous task, Fungal Corruption._\nTarson Lonewolf spends a moment reading the report. His eyes grow big then he frowns. Once done he stares at you. 'You [will help me] look into this.'\nYou say, 'Yes sir. I will help you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Spiritual Corruption'.\nTarson Lonewolf says, 'Good. I heard rumors that there are some elemental beings in Shadow Haven. They should not be here. I need you to take samples and let me know if you see anything suspicious. Start with hopefully clean stone samples in another region so we can do a comparison.'\n\n---\n\n_Tarson Lonewolf needs you to check on the spirit energy found by Coglixar Xorlopodil. These samples will infuse stones._\n_Collect some stones of various sizes from nearby regions. Find them in:_\n_Underbulks in Firefall Pass and Paludal Depths. these creatures may have something unusual about them._\n_Rockhoppers in Shadeweaver's Tangle_\n_Stone creatures in the Ruins of Shadow Haven_\n_Watch the area around the spirit touched stones for something unusual._\n1\\. Collect 2 Faintly Glowing Digested Pebble(s) 0/2 (Firefall Pass)\nFaintly Glowing Digested Pebble drops from a Firefall hollower and a luclinite borer\n2\\. Collect 2 Faintly Glowing Digested Stone(s) 0/2 (Paludal Depths)\nFaintly Glowing Digested Stone drops from \"a royal guardian\"\n3\\. Collect 2 Weakly Glowing Pebble(s) 0/2 (Shadeweaver's Tangle)\nWeakly Glowing Pebble drops from \"a mature hopper\" and \"a needle clawed hopper\" and a clawed hopper\n4\\. Collect 2 Glowing Stone(s) 0/2 (Ruins of Shadow Haven)\nGlowing Stone drops from spirit touched debris, spirit-touched rubble, and spirit touched scrap.\n5\\. Collect 2 Glowing Rock(s) 0/2 (Ruins of Shadow Haven)\nGlowing Rock drops from \"animated debris\", \"animated rubble\" and \"animated scrap\".\n6\\. Watch for something unusual 0/1 (Ruins of Shadow Haven)\n_Commander Yaminsharvaylin is acting cagey._\nI received this update while standing still in the rock area dealing with loot. I was standing still for a couple minutes. Didn't have to do anything else. Not sure on specific mechanics for this update\n7\\. Create 1 Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag using tradeskills. 0/1 (ALL)\n_Seal the Spiritual Sample Bag_\nCombine the 10 rocks inside the Spiritual Sample Bag to create a Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag [item=145315].\n8\\. Deliver 1 Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag to Tarson Lonewolf 0/1 (Ruins of Shadow Haven)\n_Give the Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag to Tarson Lonewolf._\nYou offered 1 Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag to Tarson Lonewolf.\nYour task 'Spiritual Corruption' has been updated.\nTarson Lonewolf studies the contents carefully, examining each rock thoroughly. 'That is concerning. There is something odd about this spiritual energy. You will need to speak to someone with a different view on the topic. Please show these stones to Lewena. While I may be more in tune with spirits than she is, she is more skilled in the natural order of things. Did you see anything or anyone [behaving oddly]?'\nYou complete the trade with Tarson Lonewolf.\n9\\. Converse with Tarson Lonewolf 0/1 (Ruins of Shadow Haven)\n_Explain that you say Commander Yaminshavraylin acting suspicious._\nYou say, 'Commander Yaminshavraylin'\nYou have been given: Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag\nYour task 'Spiritual Corruption' has been updated.\nTarson Lonewolf's skin turns pale, and his eyes widen. 'That is disturbing. As our commander, don't approach her. I'll speak with her while you talk to Lewena.'\n10\\. Deliver 1 Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag to Lewena 0/1 (Ruins of Shadow Haven)\n_Give the Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag to Lewena_\nYou offered 1 Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag to Lewena.\nYou have been given: Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag\nYour task 'Spiritual Corruption' has been updated.\nLewena seems instantly sober. She opens the bag and looks at the rocks. Her lips snarl up toward her nose, and she frowns. 'What did someone do? This is horrible. It's like the spirits are crying out in [pain]!'\nYou complete the trade with Lewena.\nYou say, 'The spirits are in pain? Do you know what is causing this?'\nLewena says, 'Yes. Pain. And no. I do not know. [Who] told you to bring this to me?'\nYou say, 'Tarson Lonewolf.'\nLewena says 'Oh. Okay. Then this isn't a prank.' She glances over her shoulder toward one of the other buildings. 'That means that something is really wrong. Tarson won't know what it is. You should go find High Spiritist Jimuul in Shar Vahl. He might be able to shed some light on what the cause of this is. Take this bag of horrors to him.'\n11\\. Deliver 1 Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag to High Spiritist Jimuul 0/1 (Shar Vahl, Divided)\n_Give the Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag to High Spiritist Jimuul in Shar Vahl_\nYou offered 1 Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag to High Spiritist Jimuul.\nHigh Spiritist Jimuul Glares at you in anger then studies the stones in the bag. His eyebrows dip into a frown. 'That is disturbing.' He shakes his head as if he's sloughing water. 'What is here are remnants, and you have not brought me spirits that you harmed. Tell whoever started you on this research that there is something consuming the spirits.'\nYou have been given: Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag\nYour task 'Spiritual Corruption' has been updated.\nYou complete the trade with High Spiritist Jimuul.\n12\\. Deliver 1 Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag to Tarson Lonewolf 0/1 (Ruins of Shadow Haven)\n_Return the Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag to Tarson Lonewolf_\nYou offered 1 Sealed Spiritual Sample Bag to Tarson Lonewolf.\nYour task 'Spiritual Corruption' has been updated.\nTarson Lonewolf says, 'Thank you. Lewena told me she sent you to see [High Spiritist Jimuul]. What did he have to say?'\nYou complete the trade with Tarson Lonewolf.\n13\\. Converse with Tarson Lonewolf 0/1 (Ruins of Shadow Haven)\nYou say, 'High Spiritist Jimuul said that something is consuming the spirits'\nYour task 'Spiritual Corruption' has been updated.\nYou determined that something is consuming the spiritual energy, even if you have not found the reason for that energy.\nYou receive 5 copper .\nYou receive 2 silver .\nYou receive 6 gold .\nYou receive 265 platinum .\nYou have gained 1 mercenary ability point(s)! You now have 12 mercenary ability point(s).\nYou have gained 36 ability point(s)! You now have 138 ability point(s).\nYou gain experience! (0.000%)\nTarson Lonewolf says, 'That is disturbing. I expect that the explosive fungal growth is caused by the spiritual corruption. I may have an inkling of the cause, but I don't want to believe it. I need some confirmation but getting it might be somewhat dangerous. Are you [interested]?'\n_This leads into the final task of the Partisan of Ruins of Shadow Haven series: Power Corrupts._\n_\n---\n_\n_Reward(s)_\n_265 platinum 6 gold 2 silver 5 copper_\n_Experience!_\n**Submitted by:** Cylius & Laurana",
