ame from someplace and left to someplace. They act like it just appeared out of nowhere. I remember what happened; I was here when the ground shook. That sound, that horrible sound, shook the ground like nothing I've known before. Then, a moment later, the beast crashed through that door, shattering much of the stone around it. And that's how it left. I'm certain of it. But none of my investigations have explained why that door is still there. Rumor has it that you have discovered something about [what is going on].'\nYou say, 'I don't know exactly what is going on, but I don't think you are wrong. There is something wrong with that door. I was following the commander, and I know I saw the door wink. I can't prove it, but I saw it! We should take more people and look more closely at the door'\nAnimist Khalan says, 'That's good to hear. It could be better to investigate with a [small] group. However, if you can bring a [large] force to the problem I guess it would be safer for you.'\nYou say, 'small'\nAnimist Khalan says, 'Maybe I'm not the crazy one around here. I would be grateful if you were to take me with you when you test out your theory. All I ask is that you let me know when you are [ready] and I will happily go with you.'\nYou have received a request timer for 'When One Door Closes': 0d:0h:1m remaining.\nYou have been assigned the task 'When One Door Closes'.\nYou say, 'ready'\nAnimist Khalan says, 'Good, good! I can't wait to find out what is going on.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\n\n---\n\nThere is something odd about the door in the north of Shadow Haven. Animist Khalan assures you that he saw a monster crash out of the door and completely destroy it. Hopefully you have the key that unlocks the mystery.\n1\\. Discover what is going on with the door. 0/1 (Ruins of Shadow Haven)\nDefeat 'Mutable Monstrosity'\n2\\. Open the chest. 0/1 (Ruins of Shadow Haven)\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n177 platinum 8 silver 4 copper\nYou gain experience!\n45 Shaded Specie\n**Submitted by:** Cylius & Laurana, Veludeus\n- Shaded Specie [item=145000]",
